<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0666_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Prof. Oak</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak...\rHmm... It’s weird.\nI know your voice, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, but\fover the phone you sound SO different.\fLike a younger me. Or a raccoon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak...\rHmm... It’s weird.\nI know your voice, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, but\fover the phone you sound SO different.\fLike a younger me. Or a raccoon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\rYou catchin’ a LOT of homies,\nain’t you?\fI can hear ’em in the background.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\nYour Pokédex fillin’ up for REAL!\fI’m so proud I could take a nap.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\rYou movin’ at a CRAZY pace!\nYou remind me of me when I was young!\fI was fast. Now I’m a professor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\rIf you get tired, take a break.\nDon’t push yourself too hard!\fI’m takin’ a nap right after this.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Professor Oak...\rWhen I record my radio show, I gotta go\nback and forth between Kanto and\fJohto. It’s TIRIN’...\fMy back hurts. My knees hurt.\rOh, but forget that! You doin’ a great\njob fillin’ your Pokédex!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\rLook like you found some homies that\nain’t from Johto OR Kanto, huh?\rYou a strong Hustler, and you makin’\nreal discoveries!\fI’m gon’ put my name on ’em. Kiddin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...This Professor Oak.\nI been so busy with research I ain’t\fslept in three days...\fI think I’m seein’ colors.\rOh, but forget that!\nYou made such good progress!\fI can’t wait to see it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\rYou notice your circle of homies got\nbigger since you started?\fThat’s the best thing about homies!\fBetter than people, honestly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\nYou know, I don’t see many great\fHustlers like you these days!\rI gotta thank Professor Elm for\nputtin’ us in touch!\fHe owes me bread, but still.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak!\nOh, you ain’t gotta say nothin’!\fI know how hard you workin’!\rI figured I’d get you a present...\fWell, I picked somethin’ up, but I\fstraight FORGOT to give it to you!\fHa ha ha! I’m old!\rIt’s somethin’ real helpful.\nJust come grab it!\rI’ll be waitin’ at my Lab in Pallet\nTown! Don’t come before noon.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak...\nOh, wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI just woke up. Talk slow.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, this Professor Oak...\nOh, wassup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI just woke up. Talk slow.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, how your Pokédex comin’ along?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quit</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Have Pokédex Evaluated</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Have Johto Pokédex Evaluated</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Have National Pokédex Evaluated</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm, lemme see...\nYou seen {STRVAR_1 52, 5, 0} homies, and\fyou caught {STRVAR_1 52, 6, 0} homies!\fI see!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Show me your Pokédex again anytime!\nI’ll be here. Prob’ly asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHEESH!\nThat’s a COMPLETE Johto Pokédex!\rThanks to you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, the Johto\nPokédex is DONE!\rSheesh...\nYou did a CRAZY job!\fI’m gon’ cry. Hold on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHEESH!\nThat’s a COMPLETE Johto Pokédex!\rThanks to you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, the Johto\nPokédex is DONE!\rSheesh...\nYou did a CRAZY job!\fI’m gon’ cry. Hold on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXCELLENT!\nThat’s a AMAZIN’ National Pokédex!\rSheesh...\nYou lived up to my expectations!\rNah, you BLEW PAST ’em, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou a GOAT Hustler!\rGood looks, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI’m namin’ a wing of the lab after you.\fIt’s a closet. But it’s yours.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXCELLENT!\nThat’s a AMAZIN’ National Pokédex!\rSheesh...\nYou lived up to my expectations!\rNah, you BLEW PAST ’em, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nYou a GOAT Hustler!\rGood looks, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI’m namin’ a wing of the lab after you.\fIt’s a closet. But it’s yours.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You deadass shocked me!\rBut just like I expected, you\nfinished the Johto Pokédex.\fI’m SO grateful!\rIf you got that much drive,\nthen even crazier adventures\fwaitin’ on you in the homie world!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You deadass shocked me!\rYou more than passed my\nexpectations. You went WAY past\f’em finishin’ the\fNational Pokédex!\rI’m speechless...!\r’cause of this, the world of homies\nand Hustlers is bigger, deeper,\fand richer!\rNow homie research ain’t\nNEVER gon’ end!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Look for homies in the grass!\nThey hidin’. They always hidin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good. I see you know how to use\nNap Sacks.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gettin’ good at this, but you got\na long way to go.\fLike, LONG long.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm, you catchin’ homies at a\ndecent pace!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tryin’--I can see that.\nYour Pokédex comin’ together.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You trainin’ ’em good. You know some\nhomies don’t evolve just from\fscrappin’, right?\fSome need a stone. Or a trade.\fOr a vibe.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got a Fishin’ Rod?\nSome homies you can ONLY find by\ffishin’!\fBring snacks. Fishin’ is borin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Excellent! You seem good at\ncollectin’ stuff!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some homies only show up\nat certain times of day.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Pokédex deadass fillin’ up.\nKeep up the grind!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m impressed.\nYou evolvin’ homies, not just\fcatchin’ ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you learn how to use the custom\nNap Sacks Kurt make,\fyou’ll catch homies way better!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you trade homies, you can also\ntrade info. Your homies can\fdeadass help you out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tradin’ your homies?\nIt’s tough doin’ this solo!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh! You hit 200!\nYour Pokédex lookin’ GREAT!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found SO many homies!\nYou deadass helped my studies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MAGNIFICENT! You got what it take to\nbe a great Homie Professor one day!\fYou’ll need a lab coat. And no sleep.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Pokédex is crazy!\nYou ready to go pro!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The goal might be far, but don’t\ngive up yet! Keep goin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t forget, some homies only show up\nat certain times of day!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you break rocks, some homies that\nwas hidin’ in there might come\fjumpin’ out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s wonderful you gathered\nthis many homies! The road\fahead long. Keep up the grind!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you Dome Check a tree, sometimes a\nhomie might fall out!\fOn your head. Wear a helmet.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A lotta homies you can’t find in\nJohto like to hang out at the\fSafari Zone.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Music on the radio might also make\nhomies jump out!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you got so far...!\nI’m actually kinda SHOOK!\fI need to sit down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This a critical moment!\nYou can’t get discouraged now!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just a lil more!\nI got high hopes for you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t NEVER in all my years seen a\nHustler this crazy!\fAnd I’m REAL old!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0666_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, how your Pokédex comin’\nalong? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
